{"format":"wenyu","version":8,"id":"p_muwbd1u9_2rj00","meta":{"title":"雾港三日","author":"文游工坊示例","desc":"一座总在下雾的港口，一个只在下雨时出门的姑娘。","cover":null,"createdAt":"2026-10-06T06:44:42.513Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-06T06:44:42.514Z"},"config":{"startNode":"n_muwbd2ta_sh0od","vars":[{"key":"好感","type":"number","initial":0,"display":"codex"},{"key":"线索","type":"number","initial":0,"display":"codex"},{"key":"知道真相","type":"bool","initial":false,"display":"codex"},{"key":"见过阿萤","type":"bool","initial":false,"display":"codex"},{"key":"见过老陈","type":"bool","initial":false,"display":"codex"}],"theme":{"bg":"#0a0916","fg":"#ece9ff","accent":"#a78bfa","fontSize":18,"font":""},"ui":{"hudTop":false,"font":null,"fontScale":1,"box":{"maxHeight":30,"style":"band","fontSize":0,"padX":0,"padY":0},"ornament":"rune","skins":{"page":"a_muwbd2sl_pdfp2","header":"a_muwbd2sx_qxtmo","button":"a_muwbd2ta_rmutc"},"skinFit":"slice","orientation":"landscape","choice":{"layout":"center","shape":"bar","align":"center","width":"narrow","bg":"a_muwbd2ls_ouiud","bgFit":"slice","x":0.5,"y":0.6,"minH":52,"gap":12,"padX":20},"saves":{"slots":4}}},"codex":{"groups":[{"id":"g_muwbd2tc_2iltdf","name":"状态","icon":"📊","kind":"status","order":0},{"id":"g_muwbd2tc_2jptv0","name":"人物","icon":"👤","kind":"list","order":1},{"id":"g_muwbd2tc_2kv91q","name":"背包","icon":"🎒","kind":"list","order":2}],"entries":[{"id":"e_muwbd2tc_2lj33k","groupId":"g_muwbd2tc_2jptv0","name":"阿萤","image":"a_muwbd29z_8bvj9","desc":"药店老板的女儿。下雨天一定出门，从不打伞。\\n据说她是在找人 —— 也有人说，她是在往雾里走。","vars":["好感"],"unlock":{"logic":"and","rules":[{"key":"见过阿萤","op":"truthy","value":""}]},"blurLocked":true},{"id":"e_muwbd2tc_2mjiy6","groupId":"g_muwbd2tc_2jptv0","name":"老陈","image":"a_muwbd2by_9at0m","desc":"码头的摆渡人。在这个缆桩旁边蹲了很多年，知道所有人的事，只是不一定说。","vars":[],"unlock":{"logic":"and","rules":[{"key":"见过老陈","op":"truthy","value":""}]},"blurLocked":true},{"id":"e_muwbd2tc_2ngz2o","groupId":"g_muwbd2tc_2jptv0","name":"船长","image":"a_muwbd2ea_a7kzn","desc":"跑雾港航线跑了四十年。他说这地方「进来容易」，下半句从来不说。","vars":[],"unlock":null,"blurLocked":true},{"id":"e_muwbd2tc_2o2e20","groupId":"g_muwbd2tc_2jptv0","name":"雾里的人","image":null,"desc":"她还不知道自己在找什么。","vars":["线索"],"unlock":{"logic":"and","rules":[{"key":"知道真相","op":"truthy","value":""}]},"blurLocked":true},{"id":"e_muwbd2tc_2pnfam","groupId":"g_muwbd2tc_2kv91q","name":"船票","image":null,"desc":"皱巴巴的，回程日期空着 —— 你本来也没打算久留。","vars":[],"unlock":null,"blurLocked":true},{"id":"e_muwbd2tc_2qu563","groupId":"g_muwbd2tc_2kv91q","name":"散落的药包","image":null,"desc":"帮她捡起来的。里面是治咳嗽的方子，包了三层油纸。","vars":[],"unlock":{"logic":"and","rules":[{"key":"见过阿萤","op":"truthy","value":""}]},"blurLocked":true},{"id":"e_muwbd2tc_2r1nr4","groupId":"g_muwbd2tc_2kv91q","name":"半截烟","image":null,"desc":"老陈摁灭在铁皮上的那半截。你没明白他为什么要留着。","vars":[],"unlock":{"logic":"and","rules":[{"key":"见过老陈","op":"truthy","value":""}]},"blurLocked":true}]},"characters":[{"id":"ch_muwbd2kj_hy2o8","name":"阿萤","sprite":"a_muwbd29z_8bvj9","faces":[{"id":"fc_muwbd2kj_ee6sy","name":"微笑","img":"a_muwbd2gf_bo78d"},{"id":"fc_muwbd2kj_fkcvh","name":"难过","img":"a_muwbd2ik_cg8v1"},{"id":"fc_muwbd2kj_gndd6","name":"惊讶","img":"a_muwbd2ki_dl04j"}],"color":""},{"id":"ch_muwbd2kj_ig10y","name":"老陈","sprite":"a_muwbd2by_9at0m","faces":[],"color":""},{"id":"ch_muwbd2kj_jq2ef","name":"船长","sprite":"a_muwbd2ea_a7kzn","faces":[],"color":""}],"assets":{"a_muwbd1xi_4pth6":{"type":"image","name":"夜港","mime":"image/png","data":"data:image/png;base64,"},"a_muwbd21a_5n3z2":{"type":"image","name":"老街","mime":"image/png","data":"data:image/png;base64,"},"a_muwbd244_6xyxy":{"type":"image","name":"客栈","mime":"image/png","data":"data:image/png;base64,"},"a_muwbd26g_75no2":{"type":"audio","name":"雾港环境音","mime":"audio/wav","data":"data:audio/wav;base64,"},"a_muwbd29z_8bvj9":{"type":"image","name":"立绘·阿萤","mime":"image/png","data":"data:image/png;base64,"},"a_muwbd2by_9at0m":{"type":"image","name":"立绘·老陈","mime":"image/png","data":"data:image/png;base64,"},"a_muwbd2ea_a7kzn":{"type":"image","name":"立绘·船长","mime":"image/png","data":"data:image/png;base64,"},"a_muwbd2gf_bo78d":{"type":"image","name":"阿萤·微笑","mime":"image/png","data":"data:image/png;base64,"},"a_muwbd2ik_cg8v1":{"type":"image","name":"阿萤·难过","mime":"image/png","data":"data:image/png;base64,"},"a_muwbd2ki_dl04j":{"type":"image","name":"阿萤·惊讶","mime":"image/png","data":"data:image/png;base64,"},"a_muwbd2kw_karjs":{"type":"image","name":"气泡·！","mime":"image/png","data":"data:image/png;base64,"},"a_muwbd2l7_lzso7":{"type":"image","name":"气泡·？","mime":"image/png","data":"data:image/png;base64,"},"a_muwbd2lf_mstjg":{"type":"image","name":"气泡·心","mime":"image/png","data":"data:image/png;base64,"},"a_muwbd2lm_nber6":{"type":"image","name":"气泡·汗","mime":"image/png","data":"data:image/png;base64,"},"a_muwbd2ls_ouiud":{"type":"image","name":"选项框·雾港","mime":"image/png","data":"data:image/png;base64,","w":240,"h":96},"a_muwbd2sl_pdfp2":{"type":"image","name":"界面·整页底","mime":"image/png","data":"data:image/png;base64,"},"a_muwbd2sx_qxtmo":{"type":"image","name":"界面·标题栏","mime":"image/png","data":"data:image/png;base64,"},"a_muwbd2ta_rmutc":{"type":"image","name":"界面·按钮底","mime":"image/png","data":"data:image/png;base64,"}},"nodes":[{"id":"n_muwbd2ta_sh0od","title":"靠岸","text":"第三天了，渡轮还是没能靠岸。\n\n雾像一块湿布蒙在舷窗上。你数着行李箱上的划痕，直到汽笛响了三声。\n\n船身轻轻一震——到了。","bg":"a_muwbd1xi_4pth6","bgm":"a_muwbd26g_75no2","sfx":null,"onEnter":[],"choices":[{"id":"c_muwbd2tb_1b2bic","text":"提起行李下船","to":"n_muwbd2tb_vgepc","once":false,"condition":null,"effects":[],"img":null,"hideText":false,"x":null,"y":null},{"id":"c_muwbd2tb_1coauu","text":"先去问问船长","to":"n_muwbd2ta_ttpgh","once":false,"condition":null,"effects":[],"img":null,"hideText":false,"x":null,"y":null}],"autoNext":null,"ending":null,"speaker":null,"choiceLayout":null,"bubbles":[],"stage":{"actors":[],"tracks":[]}},{"id":"n_muwbd2ta_ttpgh","title":"船长室","text":"船长是个脸被海风吹皱的老头。他没回头，只说了一句：\n\n「雾港这地方，进来容易。想出去，就得看运气了。」","bg":"a_muwbd1xi_4pth6","bgm":"a_muwbd26g_75no2","sfx":null,"onEnter":[{"op":"add","key":"线索","value":1}],"choices":[{"id":"c_muwbd2tb_1doijt","text":"「什么意思？」","to":"n_muwbd2tb_uyqoy","once":false,"condition":null,"effects":[],"img":null,"hideText":false,"x":null,"y":null},{"id":"c_muwbd2tb_1enw68","text":"把这句话记在心里","to":"n_muwbd2tb_vgepc","once":false,"condition":null,"effects":[],"img":null,"hideText":false,"x":null,"y":null}],"autoNext":null,"ending":null,"speaker":"船长","choiceLayout":null,"bubbles":[],"stage":{"actors":[{"id":"ac_muwbd2td_2s2z45","character":"ch_muwbd2kj_jq2ef","sprite":null,"faces":[],"name":"","dim":true,"z":0}],"tracks":[{"actorId":"ac_muwbd2td_2s2z45","keys":[{"id":"k_muwbd2td_2ttln2","at":0,"x":-0.2,"y":1,"scale":1.02,"opacity":1,"flip":false},{"id":"k_muwbd2td_2umlat","at":520,"x":0.52,"y":1,"scale":1.02,"opacity":1,"flip":false}]}]}},{"id":"n_muwbd2tb_uyqoy","title":"船长的话","text":"他终于转过身，看了你很久。\n\n「……每年这个时候都有人来。来的比走的多。」\n\n他把烟摁灭在铁皮上，不再说话。","bg":"a_muwbd1xi_4pth6","bgm":"a_muwbd26g_75no2","sfx":null,"onEnter":[{"op":"add","key":"线索","value":1}],"choices":[{"id":"c_muwbd2tb_1f346j","text":"下船","to":"n_muwbd2tb_vgepc","once":false,"condition":null,"effects":[],"img":null,"hideText":false,"x":null,"y":null}],"autoNext":null,"ending":null,"speaker":"船长","choiceLayout":null,"bubbles":[],"stage":{"actors":[{"id":"ac_muwbd2te_2v8tnl","character":"ch_muwbd2kj_jq2ef","sprite":null,"faces":[],"name":"","dim":true,"z":0}],"tracks":[{"actorId":"ac_muwbd2te_2v8tnl","keys":[{"id":"k_muwbd2te_2wv131","at":0,"x":0.52,"y":1,"scale":1.02,"opacity":1,"flip":false}]}]}},{"id":"n_muwbd2tb_vgepc","title":"码头","text":"码头上只有一个人。老陈，摆渡人，蹲在缆桩旁边抽烟。\n\n「住店？」他头也不抬，「往里走，第三家。」","bg":"a_muwbd1xi_4pth6","bgm":"a_muwbd26g_75no2","sfx":null,"onEnter":[],"choices":[{"id":"c_muwbd2tb_2134oi","text":"跟他搭话","to":"n_muwbd2tb_wxx7l","once":false,"condition":null,"effects":[],"img":null,"hideText":false,"x":null,"y":null},{"id":"c_muwbd2tb_22yptg","text":"沉默着走开","to":"n_muwbd2tb_ylu56","once":false,"condition":null,"effects":[],"img":null,"hideText":false,"x":null,"y":null}],"autoNext":null,"ending":null,"speaker":"老陈","choiceLayout":null,"bubbles":[],"stage":{"actors":[{"id":"ac_muwbd2te_2xcv8y","character":"ch_muwbd2kj_ig10y","sprite":null,"faces":[],"name":"","dim":true,"z":0}],"tracks":[{"actorId":"ac_muwbd2te_2xcv8y","keys":[{"id":"k_muwbd2te_2yjmlc","at":0,"x":1.2,"y":1,"scale":1,"opacity":1,"flip":false},{"id":"k_muwbd2te_2zjbd0","at":520,"x":0.46,"y":1,"scale":1,"opacity":1,"flip":false}]}]}},{"id":"n_muwbd2tb_wxx7l","title":"老陈","text":"老陈把烟蒂弹进水里，这才抬眼看你。\n\n「生面孔。这个季节来雾港的，都是找人的。」","bg":"a_muwbd1xi_4pth6","bgm":"a_muwbd26g_75no2","sfx":null,"onEnter":[{"op":"set","key":"见过老陈","value":true}],"choices":[{"id":"c_muwbd2tb_23hiyx","text":"「打听个人。一个姑娘，下雨天总出门。」","to":"n_muwbd2tb_xlu9z","once":false,"condition":{"logic":"and","rules":[{"key":"线索","op":">=","value":1}]},"effects":[],"img":null,"hideText":false,"x":null,"y":null},{"id":"c_muwbd2tb_24qsd0","text":"摇头，往老街走","to":"n_muwbd2tb_ylu56","once":false,"condition":null,"effects":[],"img":null,"hideText":false,"x":null,"y":null}],"autoNext":null,"ending":null,"speaker":"老陈","choiceLayout":null,"bubbles":[],"stage":{"actors":[{"id":"ac_muwbd2te_3010xu","character":"ch_muwbd2kj_ig10y","sprite":null,"faces":[],"name":"","dim":true,"z":0}],"tracks":[{"actorId":"ac_muwbd2te_3010xu","keys":[{"id":"k_muwbd2te_31r4z8","at":0,"x":0.46,"y":1,"scale":1,"opacity":1,"flip":false}]}]}},{"id":"n_muwbd2tb_xlu9z","title":"老陈知道的","text":"「下雨天出门的姑娘？」他笑了一下，笑得很轻。\n\n「你说阿萤吧。她娘三年前也是这么没的——下着雨，进了雾里，就没再出来。」\n\n他顿了顿：「她天天往外跑，是在找。」","bg":"a_muwbd1xi_4pth6","bgm":"a_muwbd26g_75no2","sfx":null,"onEnter":[{"op":"add","key":"线索","value":1}],"choices":[{"id":"c_muwbd2tb_1k4ibs","text":"道谢，往老街走","to":"n_muwbd2tb_ylu56","once":false,"condition":null,"effects":[],"img":null,"hideText":false,"x":null,"y":null}],"autoNext":null,"ending":null,"speaker":"老陈","choiceLayout":null,"bubbles":[],"stage":{"actors":[{"id":"ac_muwbd2te_32xb1j","character":"ch_muwbd2kj_ig10y","sprite":null,"faces":[],"name":"","dim":true,"z":0}],"tracks":[{"actorId":"ac_muwbd2te_32xb1j","keys":[{"id":"k_muwbd2te_332g0f","at":0,"x":0.46,"y":1,"scale":1,"opacity":1,"flip":false}]}]}},{"id":"n_muwbd2tb_ylu56","title":"老街","text":"老街的石板被雨泡得发亮。第三家客栈的灯是暖的，但你没进去。\n\n因为你先看见了她。\n\n药店门口的台阶上，一个姑娘正弯着腰，把散落一地的药包一个一个捡起来。雨很大，她没打伞。","bg":"a_muwbd21a_5n3z2","bgm":null,"sfx":null,"onEnter":[],"choices":[{"id":"c_muwbd2tb_1l86zn","text":"走过去","to":"n_muwbd2tb_z5r72","once":false,"condition":null,"effects":[],"img":null,"hideText":false,"x":null,"y":null}],"autoNext":null,"ending":null,"speaker":null,"choiceLayout":null,"bubbles":[],"stage":{"actors":[{"id":"ac_muwbd2te_3oyu76","character":"ch_muwbd2kj_hy2o8","sprite":null,"faces":[],"name":"","dim":true,"z":0}],"tracks":[{"actorId":"ac_muwbd2te_3oyu76","keys":[{"id":"k_muwbd2tf_3pp2jq","at":400,"x":-0.2,"y":1,"scale":0.72,"opacity":0.9,"flip":false},{"id":"k_muwbd2tf_3qv9k9","at":920,"x":0.32,"y":1,"scale":0.72,"opacity":0.9,"flip":false}]}]}},{"id":"n_muwbd2tb_z5r72","title":"阿萤","text":"她捡完了最后一个药包，直起身，才发现你站在雨里看她。\n\n「……你挡着光了。」她说。","bg":"a_muwbd21a_5n3z2","bgm":null,"sfx":null,"onEnter":[{"op":"set","key":"见过阿萤","value":true},{"op":"face","actorId":"ac_muwbd2te_34s4a7","face":"难过"}],"choices":[{"id":"c_muwbd2tb_25vmit","text":"蹲下去帮她捡","to":"n_muwbd2tb_10zv0v","once":false,"condition":null,"effects":[],"img":null,"hideText":false,"x":0.36,"y":0.4},{"id":"c_muwbd2tb_26p19x","text":"站着不动","to":"n_muwbd2tb_11okd9","once":false,"condition":null,"effects":[],"img":null,"hideText":false,"x":0.64,"y":0.58},{"id":"c_muwbd2tb_27o6sg","text":"转身进客栈","to":"n_muwbd2tb_13jo2b","once":false,"condition":null,"effects":[],"img":null,"hideText":false,"x":0.38,"y":0.78}],"autoNext":null,"ending":null,"speaker":"阿萤","choiceLayout":"free","bubbles":[{"id":"bb_muwbd2tg_49s8ig","img":"a_muwbd2kw_karjs","x":0.63,"y":0.15,"scale":1,"flip":false,"anim":"pop","at":500,"dur":0}],"stage":{"actors":[{"id":"ac_muwbd2te_34s4a7","character":"ch_muwbd2kj_hy2o8","sprite":null,"faces":[],"name":"","dim":true,"z":0}],"tracks":[{"actorId":"ac_muwbd2te_34s4a7","keys":[{"id":"k_muwbd2te_359syw","at":0,"x":0.5,"y":1,"scale":1,"opacity":0,"flip":false},{"id":"k_muwbd2te_36ip7w","at":500,"x":0.5,"y":1,"scale":1,"opacity":1,"flip":false}]}]}},{"id":"n_muwbd2tb_10zv0v","title":"伸手","text":"你没说话，蹲下去帮她把最后几个药包拢起来。\n\n她愣了一下，接过药包的时候，指尖是冰的。\n\n「……谢谢。」声音比刚才软了些。","bg":"a_muwbd21a_5n3z2","bgm":null,"sfx":null,"onEnter":[{"op":"add","key":"好感","value":2},{"op":"face","actorId":"ac_muwbd2te_37pfg9","face":"微笑"}],"choices":[{"id":"c_muwbd2tb_1p5rjl","text":"问她为什么下雨还出门","to":"n_muwbd2tb_12cbb3","once":false,"condition":null,"effects":[],"img":null,"hideText":false,"x":null,"y":null}],"autoNext":null,"ending":null,"speaker":"阿萤","choiceLayout":null,"bubbles":[{"id":"bb_muwbd2tg_4a2ynq","img":"a_muwbd2lf_mstjg","x":0.63,"y":0.16,"scale":1,"flip":false,"anim":"float","at":700,"dur":0}],"stage":{"actors":[{"id":"ac_muwbd2te_37pfg9","character":"ch_muwbd2kj_hy2o8","sprite":null,"faces":[],"name":"","dim":true,"z":0}],"tracks":[{"actorId":"ac_muwbd2te_37pfg9","keys":[{"id":"k_muwbd2te_383g0l","at":0,"x":0.5,"y":1,"scale":1,"opacity":1,"flip":false},{"id":"k_muwbd2tf_41qjg9","at":200,"x":0.5,"y":1,"scale":1,"opacity":1,"flip":false},{"id":"k_muwbd2tf_42v1bl","at":270,"x":0.53,"y":1,"scale":1,"opacity":1,"flip":false},{"id":"k_muwbd2tg_434koa","at":340,"x":0.47,"y":1,"scale":1,"opacity":1,"flip":false},{"id":"k_muwbd2tg_444qo9","at":410,"x":0.53,"y":1,"scale":1,"opacity":1,"flip":false},{"id":"k_muwbd2tg_45ashz","at":480,"x":0.47,"y":1,"scale":1,"opacity":1,"flip":false},{"id":"k_muwbd2tg_46dogd","at":550,"x":0.53,"y":1,"scale":1,"opacity":1,"flip":false},{"id":"k_muwbd2tg_47bwq8","at":620,"x":0.47,"y":1,"scale":1,"opacity":1,"flip":false},{"id":"k_muwbd2tg_487zs9","at":690,"x":0.5,"y":1,"scale":1,"opacity":1,"flip":false}]}]}},{"id":"n_muwbd2tb_11okd9","title":"站着看","text":"你就那么站着看完了全过程。\n\n她把最后一个药包塞进布兜，抬头瞪了你一眼，绕开你走了。","bg":"a_muwbd21a_5n3z2","bgm":null,"sfx":null,"onEnter":[{"op":"add","key":"好感","value":-1},{"op":"face","actorId":"ac_muwbd2te_39dgh4","face":"难过"}],"choices":[{"id":"c_muwbd2tb_1qriuq","text":"跟上去","to":"n_muwbd2tb_12cbb3","once":false,"condition":null,"effects":[],"img":null,"hideText":false,"x":null,"y":null}],"autoNext":null,"ending":null,"speaker":"阿萤","choiceLayout":null,"bubbles":[{"id":"bb_muwbd2tg_4budkp","img":"a_muwbd2lm_nber6","x":0.62,"y":0.17,"scale":1,"flip":false,"anim":"blink","at":600,"dur":0}],"stage":{"actors":[{"id":"ac_muwbd2te_39dgh4","character":"ch_muwbd2kj_hy2o8","sprite":null,"faces":[],"name":"","dim":true,"z":0}],"tracks":[{"actorId":"ac_muwbd2te_39dgh4","keys":[{"id":"k_muwbd2te_3a69lz","at":0,"x":0.5,"y":1,"scale":1,"opacity":1,"flip":false}]}]}},{"id":"n_muwbd2tb_12cbb3","title":"为什么","text":"「为什么下雨还出门？」\n\n她抱着布兜，看了你一会儿，像在判断你配不配听答案。\n\n「因为只有在雾里的时候，我才找得到她。」\n\n她说完就走了。你记住了这句话——还有她说这话时的表情。","bg":"a_muwbd21a_5n3z2","bgm":null,"sfx":null,"onEnter":[{"op":"add","key":"线索","value":1},{"op":"face","actorId":"ac_muwbd2te_3b35jq","face":"难过"}],"choices":[{"id":"c_muwbd2tb_28hvq6","text":"去客栈","to":"n_muwbd2tb_13jo2b","once":false,"condition":null,"effects":[],"img":null,"hideText":false,"x":null,"y":null}],"autoNext":null,"ending":null,"speaker":"阿萤","choiceLayout":null,"bubbles":[],"stage":{"actors":[{"id":"ac_muwbd2te_3b35jq","character":"ch_muwbd2kj_hy2o8","sprite":null,"faces":[],"name":"","dim":true,"z":0}],"tracks":[{"actorId":"ac_muwbd2te_3b35jq","keys":[{"id":"k_muwbd2te_3c4hn8","at":0,"x":0.5,"y":1,"scale":1,"opacity":1,"flip":false}]}]}},{"id":"n_muwbd2tb_13jo2b","title":"第一夜","text":"客栈的房间很小，窗外就是雾。你把湿衣服搭在椅背上，坐在床边。\n\n今天记下的东西还热着。","bg":"a_muwbd244_6xyxy","bgm":null,"sfx":null,"onEnter":[],"choices":[{"id":"c_muwbd2tb_29fh7q","text":"把今天记下的东西翻出来，一件一件摆好","to":"n_muwbd2tb_141ba3","once":false,"condition":{"logic":"and","rules":[{"key":"线索","op":">=","value":2}]},"effects":[],"img":null,"hideText":false,"x":null,"y":null},{"id":"c_muwbd2tb_2adlje","text":"不想了，睡","to":"n_muwbd2tb_15higu","once":false,"condition":null,"effects":[],"img":null,"hideText":false,"x":null,"y":null}],"autoNext":null,"ending":null,"speaker":null,"choiceLayout":null,"bubbles":[],"stage":{"actors":[],"tracks":[]}},{"id":"n_muwbd2tb_141ba3","title":"拼起来的事","text":"你把两句话摆在一起——\n\n船长的「来的比走的多」。\n老陈的「她天天往外跑，是在找」。\n\n再加上她自己那句「只有在雾里，我才找得到她」。\n\n你忽然明白了：阿萤不是在找她娘。\n\n她是在往雾里走。一步一步地走。","bg":"a_muwbd244_6xyxy","bgm":null,"sfx":null,"onEnter":[{"op":"set","key":"知道真相","value":true}],"choices":[{"id":"c_muwbd2tb_2b2ykm","text":"睡下","to":"n_muwbd2tb_15higu","once":false,"condition":null,"effects":[],"img":null,"hideText":false,"x":null,"y":null}],"autoNext":null,"ending":null,"speaker":null,"choiceLayout":null,"bubbles":[],"stage":{"actors":[{"id":"ac_muwbd2tf_3x0iv1","character":"ch_muwbd2kj_hy2o8","sprite":null,"faces":[],"name":"","dim":true,"z":0}],"tracks":[{"actorId":"ac_muwbd2tf_3x0iv1","keys":[{"id":"k_muwbd2tf_3znh1n","at":0,"x":0.5,"y":1,"scale":0.9,"opacity":0.35,"flip":false},{"id":"k_muwbd2tf_40ninr","at":2200,"x":0.5,"y":1,"scale":1.06,"opacity":0.9,"flip":false}]}]}},{"id":"n_muwbd2tb_15higu","title":"第二天","text":"第二天早上，雾没散。\n\n雨还在下。","bg":"a_muwbd21a_5n3z2","bgm":null,"sfx":null,"onEnter":[],"choices":[{"id":"c_muwbd2tb_2ckosh","text":"去找阿萤","to":"n_muwbd2tb_16yx2u","once":false,"condition":null,"effects":[],"img":null,"hideText":false,"x":0.34,"y":0.44},{"id":"c_muwbd2tb_2d0wa3","text":"去码头找老陈","to":"n_muwbd2tb_170ncs","once":false,"condition":null,"effects":[],"img":null,"hideText":false,"x":0.66,"y":0.62}],"autoNext":null,"ending":null,"speaker":null,"choiceLayout":"free","bubbles":[],"stage":{"actors":[{"id":"ac_muwbd2tf_3ry1n4","character":"ch_muwbd2kj_ig10y","sprite":null,"faces":[],"name":"","dim":false,"z":0},{"id":"ac_muwbd2tf_3ufkcx","character":"ch_muwbd2kj_hy2o8","sprite":null,"faces":[],"name":"","dim":true,"z":10}],"tracks":[{"actorId":"ac_muwbd2tf_3ry1n4","keys":[{"id":"k_muwbd2tf_3s1dvi","at":0,"x":0.22,"y":1,"scale":0.6,"opacity":0,"flip":false},{"id":"k_muwbd2tf_3t0a6d","at":500,"x":0.22,"y":1,"scale":0.6,"opacity":0.75,"flip":false}]},{"actorId":"ac_muwbd2tf_3ufkcx","keys":[{"id":"k_muwbd2tf_3vkydt","at":260,"x":1.2,"y":1,"scale":0.95,"opacity":1,"flip":false},{"id":"k_muwbd2tf_3wk8em","at":780,"x":0.68,"y":1,"scale":0.95,"opacity":1,"flip":false}]}]}},{"id":"n_muwbd2tb_16yx2u","title":"再遇阿萤","text":"你又在药店门口看见了她。这次她手里没有药包，只有一把没收起的伞。\n\n「你怎么还在。」她说，不是问句。","bg":"a_muwbd21a_5n3z2","bgm":null,"sfx":null,"onEnter":[{"op":"face","actorId":"ac_muwbd2te_3dqpw6","face":"惊讶"}],"choices":[{"id":"c_muwbd2tb_2e7ya3","text":"把真相告诉她","to":"n_muwbd2tb_185yp2","once":false,"condition":{"logic":"and","rules":[{"key":"知道真相","op":"truthy","value":""}]},"effects":[],"img":null,"hideText":false,"x":null,"y":null},{"id":"c_muwbd2tb_2f1t6z","text":"什么都不说","to":"n_muwbd2tb_19d88t","once":false,"condition":null,"effects":[],"img":null,"hideText":false,"x":null,"y":null}],"autoNext":null,"ending":null,"speaker":"阿萤","choiceLayout":null,"bubbles":[{"id":"bb_muwbd2tg_4c1116","img":"a_muwbd2l7_lzso7","x":0.63,"y":0.14,"scale":1,"flip":false,"anim":"pop","at":400,"dur":2400}],"stage":{"actors":[{"id":"ac_muwbd2te_3dqpw6","character":"ch_muwbd2kj_hy2o8","sprite":null,"faces":[],"name":"","dim":true,"z":0}],"tracks":[{"actorId":"ac_muwbd2te_3dqpw6","keys":[{"id":"k_muwbd2te_3ekz6y","at":0,"x":1.2,"y":1,"scale":1,"opacity":1,"flip":false},{"id":"k_muwbd2te_3fc5hf","at":520,"x":0.5,"y":1,"scale":1,"opacity":1,"flip":false}]}]}},{"id":"n_muwbd2tb_170ncs","title":"找老陈","text":"老陈还在那个缆桩旁边，像昨天一样，像很多年一样。\n\n「还没走？」","bg":"a_muwbd1xi_4pth6","bgm":null,"sfx":null,"onEnter":[],"choices":[{"id":"c_muwbd2tb_2gcw3k","text":"「明天走。」","to":"n_muwbd2tb_1azfp2","once":false,"condition":null,"effects":[],"img":null,"hideText":false,"x":null,"y":null},{"id":"c_muwbd2tb_2hh59k","text":"「再待一天。」","to":"n_muwbd2tb_16yx2u","once":false,"condition":null,"effects":[],"img":null,"hideText":false,"x":null,"y":null}],"autoNext":null,"ending":null,"speaker":"老陈","choiceLayout":null,"bubbles":[],"stage":{"actors":[{"id":"ac_muwbd2te_3gnan6","character":"ch_muwbd2kj_ig10y","sprite":null,"faces":[],"name":"","dim":true,"z":0}],"tracks":[{"actorId":"ac_muwbd2te_3gnan6","keys":[{"id":"k_muwbd2te_3hmbru","at":0,"x":0.46,"y":1,"scale":1,"opacity":0,"flip":false},{"id":"k_muwbd2te_3iak5g","at":500,"x":0.46,"y":1,"scale":1,"opacity":1,"flip":false}]}]}},{"id":"n_muwbd2tb_185yp2","title":"结局 · 雾散","text":"","bg":"a_muwbd21a_5n3z2","bgm":null,"sfx":null,"onEnter":[{"op":"face","actorId":"ac_muwbd2te_3jvcwk","face":"微笑"}],"choices":[],"autoNext":null,"ending":{"title":"雾散","text":"你把知道的事全说了。\n\n她听了很久，久到雨小下去。然后她第一次收起了伞。\n\n「原来我一直都知道。」她说，「我只是不想承认。」\n\n第三天早上，雾真的散了。她来码头送你，没有打伞。"},"speaker":null,"choiceLayout":null,"bubbles":[],"stage":{"actors":[{"id":"ac_muwbd2te_3jvcwk","character":"ch_muwbd2kj_hy2o8","sprite":null,"faces":[],"name":"","dim":true,"z":0}],"tracks":[{"actorId":"ac_muwbd2te_3jvcwk","keys":[{"id":"k_muwbd2te_3k9f5n","at":0,"x":0.5,"y":1,"scale":1,"opacity":0,"flip":false},{"id":"k_muwbd2te_3ls0b6","at":500,"x":0.5,"y":1,"scale":1,"opacity":1,"flip":false}]}]}},{"id":"n_muwbd2tb_19d88t","title":"结局 · 第四天","text":"","bg":"a_muwbd1xi_4pth6","bgm":null,"sfx":null,"onEnter":[],"choices":[],"autoNext":null,"ending":{"title":"第四天","text":"你什么都没说。\n\n第三天，雨还在下。第四天，你走了。\n\n渡轮离港的时候，你看见岸上有个人影，很小，正朝着雾里走。\n\n你没有喊。"},"speaker":null,"choiceLayout":null,"bubbles":[],"stage":{"actors":[{"id":"ac_muwbd2te_3mni7r","character":"ch_muwbd2kj_hy2o8","sprite":null,"faces":[],"name":"","dim":true,"z":0}],"tracks":[{"actorId":"ac_muwbd2te_3mni7r","keys":[{"id":"k_muwbd2te_3n5qps","at":0,"x":0.5,"y":1,"scale":1,"opacity":1,"flip":false}]}]}},{"id":"n_muwbd2tb_1azfp2","title":"结局 · 离港","text":"","bg":"a_muwbd1xi_4pth6","bgm":null,"sfx":null,"onEnter":[],"choices":[],"autoNext":null,"ending":{"title":"离港","text":"「明天走。」你说。\n\n老陈点点头，好像早知道了。\n\n「雾港这地方，」他把烟摁灭，「进来容易。」\n\n他没说下半句。你也没问。"},"speaker":null,"choiceLayout":null,"bubbles":[],"stage":{"actors":[],"tracks":[]}}]}